26 November 2026, Tamil Nadu Chief Minister C. C Joseph Vijay announced 15 days of paternity leave for married male employees of the State government.","ids":[171033],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8]},{"text":"The policy is a first for the state of Tamil Nadu, joining states such as Kerala, Sikkim and Haryana in introducing paternity leave provisions for government employees.","ids":[171031,171046],"class":"single","sources":[2,7]}],[{"text":"The government decision followed requests from male employees seeking formal paternity leave provisions, the order said.","ids":[171038],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,3,6,7,8]}],[{"text":"Married male government employees may avail 15 days of paternity leave either 15 days before childbirth or within six months following the birth of the baby.","ids":[171041,171049],"class":"partial","sources":[3,4,5,6,7,8]}],[{"text":"The father's role in providing physical and emotional support is important for the mother and child, Vijay said.","ids":[171050],"class":"single","sources":[5]}],[{"text":"Female government employees in Tamil Nadu are entitled to 365 days of maternity leave, and male government employees can take the 15-day paternity leave 15 days before the birth or within six months after the birth.","ids":[171045,171049],"class":"unverified","sources":[4,5,6,7,8]}]],"section_keys":["news","background","happened","say","say","say","numbers"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://thesouthfirst.com/tamilnadu/tamil-nadu-cm-announces-15-day-paternity-leave-for-male-government-employees/","outlet":"The South First","title":"Tamil Nadu CM announces 15-day paternity leave for male government employees","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.news18.com/videos/india/breaking-tamil-nadu-introduces-15-days-of-paternity-leave-for-government-employees-tvk-news18-10441936.html","outlet":"News18","title":"Breaking | Tamil Nadu Introduces 15 Days Of Paternity Leave For Government Employees | TVK | News18","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":3,"url":"https://www.business-standard.com/india-news/tamil-nadu-cm-announces-15-days-paternity-leave-for-male-govt-employees-126112600731_1.html","outlet":"Business Standard","title":"Tamil Nadu CM announces 15 days paternity leave for male govt employees","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":4,"url":"https://www.indiatoday.in/india/tamil-nadu/story/tamil-nadu-paternity-leave-cm-vijay-male-government-employees-15-days-first-time-3047368-2026-11-26","outlet":"India Today","title":"In a first, CM Vijay announces 15-day paternity leave for male TN govt employees","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":5,"url":"https://www.livehindustan.com/national/first-time-in-tamil-nadu-15-days-paternity-leave-for-male-employees-chief-minister-thalapathy-vijay-announcement-201795687084236.html","outlet":"Live Hindustan","title":"थलपति विजय सरकार ने तमिलनाडु में पहली बार दी ऐसी सौगात! इन पुरुष कर्मियों को एकमुश्त 15 दिन छुट्टी का ऐलान","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":6,"url":"https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/tamil-nadu/tamil-nadu-introduces-15-days-of-paternity-leave-for-married-government-employees/article71745892.ece","outlet":"The Hindu","title":"Tamil Nadu introduces 15 days of paternity leave for married government employees","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":7,"url":"https://www.newindianexpress.com/states/tamil-nadu/2026/Nov/26/tamil-nadu-introduces-15-day-paternity-leave-for-male-government-employees","outlet":"The New Indian Express","title":"Tamil Nadu introduces 15-day paternity leave for male government employees","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":8,"url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/tamil-nadu-introduces-15-day-paternity-leave-for-male-govt-employees-for-first-time/articleshow/136185539.cms","outlet":"Times of India","title":"Vijay govt announces 15-day paternity leave for govt employees for first time","p